<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: construct band antenna -->
  <VR_BurnoutConstructLinkBooster.label>构装体频带天线</VR_BurnoutConstructLinkBooster.label>
  <!-- EN: A mech-band signaling device. When activated, it puts out a powerful mech signal pulse, which will attract an ultra-heavy feral mechanoid to attack with its escorts. If you can defeat it, you can collect special technologies from its corpse. The signal pulse burns out the transmitter, so this building can only be used once. -->
  <VR_BurnoutConstructLinkBooster.description>一种机甲频带信号装置。激活后会释放强力机甲信号脉冲，吸引一只超重型野性机械体及其护卫前来攻击。若能击败它，你可以从其尸体上获取特殊技术。信号脉冲会烧毁发射器，因此该建筑只能使用一次。</VR_BurnoutConstructLinkBooster.description>
  <!-- EN: Summon scarab queen threat -->
  <VR_BurnoutConstructLinkBooster.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>召唤战争女皇威胁</VR_BurnoutConstructLinkBooster.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>
  
  <!-- EN: construct band dish -->
  <VR_BurnoutConstructLinkBooster_Large.label>构装体频带碟</VR_BurnoutConstructLinkBooster_Large.label>
  <!-- EN: A mech-band signaling device. When activated, it puts out a powerful mech signal pulse, which will attract an ultra-heavy feral mechanoid to attack with its escorts. If you can defeat it, you can collect special technologies from its corpse. The signal pulse burns out the transmitter, so this building can only be used once. -->
  <VR_BurnoutConstructLinkBooster_Large.description>一种机甲频带信号装置。激活后会释放强力机甲信号脉冲，吸引一只超重型野性机械体及其护卫前来攻击。若能击败它，你可以从其尸体上获取特殊技术。信号脉冲会烧毁发射器，因此该建筑只能使用一次。</VR_BurnoutConstructLinkBooster_Large.description>
  <!-- EN: Summon apocriton threat -->
  <VR_BurnoutConstructLinkBooster_Large.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>召唤憎恶毒蜂威胁</VR_BurnoutConstructLinkBooster_Large.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>
  
  <!-- EN: harmonic comms dish -->
  <VR_ConstructBandDish.label>构装体频带碟</VR_ConstructBandDish.label>
  <!-- EN: Allows radio contact with other factions and orbital traders. -->
  <VR_ConstructBandDish.description>允许与其他派系及轨道商人进行无线电联系。</VR_ConstructBandDish.description>
  <!-- EN: Summon colossus threat -->
  <VR_ConstructBandDish.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>召唤巨像威胁</VR_ConstructBandDish.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>
  
  <!-- EN: trade beacon -->
  <VR_Steam_TradeBeacon.label>贸易信标</VR_Steam_TradeBeacon.label>
  <!-- EN: Required for tonal displacement trading. You can only sell goods if they're near an trade beacon. Can be placed indoors. -->
  <VR_Steam_TradeBeacon.description>进行谐波位移贸易所必需。只有位于贸易信标附近的货物才能出售。可放置于室内。</VR_Steam_TradeBeacon.description>
  
</LanguageData>
